    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the ninja art of wall-running while fighting room after room of syndicate thugs and deadly robots in this unique top-down action shooter.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imperial Tower is the headquarters of a crime syndicate that has kidnapped two children of the ninja clan.  To rescue them, a lone ninja must take on floor after floor of deadly enemies until he reaches the secret basement vault. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ninja Movement: Learn how to survive while running across the four walls of a room. Jump from wall to wall or corner to corner to dodge attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grappling Hook: Grab weapons and items and interact with the environment with your grappling hook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Falling with Style: Avoid obstacles as you descend through the ducts of Imperial Tower's ventilation system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock Equipment: Picking up new weapons and items unlocks them so you can bring them on the next attempt. Finding vent keys unlocks shortcuts through the tower.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the ninja art of wall-running while fighting room after room of syndicate thugs and deadly robots in this unique top-down action shooter.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imperial Tower is the headquarters of a crime syndicate that has kidnapped two children of the ninja clan.  To rescue them, a lone ninja must take on floor after floor of deadly enemies until he reaches the secret basement vault. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ninja Movement: Learn how to survive while running across the four walls of a room. Jump from wall to wall or corner to corner to dodge attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grappling Hook: Grab weapons and items and interact with the environment with your grappling hook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Falling with Style: Avoid obstacles as you descend through the ducts of Imperial Tower's ventilation system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock Equipment: Picking up new weapons and items unlocks them so you can bring them on the next attempt. Finding vent keys unlocks shortcuts through the tower.</p></li></ul>",
